            "title": "Mission Produce to Acquire Rival Avocado Producer Calavo in $483 Million Deal",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Mission Produce  has agreed to acquire  Calavo Growers  combining two of the most prominent publicly traded avocado producers.  Calavo stockholders will receive $27 a share as part of the deal, comprising $14.85 in cash and about 0.98 of a share of Mission\u2019s stock for each Calavo share, the companies said Wednesday.  The deal will create more sourcing security and help Mission\u2014one the biggest publicly traded avocado producers in the U.S.\u2014to expand its presence in North America, Mission said.",
